    "preamble": "Ravi Shanker Pandey vs State Of Up And 2 Others on 6 August, 2024 High Court Of Judicature At Allahabad ?Neutral Citation No. - 2024:Ahc:126766 Court No. - 5 Case :- Writ - A No. - 11142 of 2024 Petitioner :- Ravi Shanker Pandey Respondent :- State Of Up And 2 Others Counsel for Petitioner :- Ashok Kumar Pandey Counsel for Respondent :- C.S.C. Hon'ble J.J. Munir,J.",
    "facts": "The petitioner, who is a Senior Assistant, posted with the establishment of the Assistant Commissioner, Food Safety and Drugs Administration, Ballia has been transferred vide the impugned order dated 30.06.2024 from Ballia to Maharajganj in public interest. has been duly recommended by the Assistant Commissioner, Food Safety and Drugs Administration, Ballia.",
